error BYN3102: `style.indent` must be a positive integer, e.g. `4`

  5 │         indent: "4",
    │                 ^^^

error BYN3102: `style.braces` must be `.sameLine` or `.nextLine`

  6 │         braces: .allman,
    │                 ^^^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.maxLine` must be a positive integer, e.g. `100`

  7 │         maxLine: 0,
    │                  ^

error BYN3102: `style.trailingCommas` must be `true` or `false`

  8 │         trailingCommas: .always,
    │                         ^^^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.booleans` must be `.symbols` or `.words`

  9 │         booleans: .both,
    │                   ^^^^^

error BYN3102: `style.primitives` must be `.sized` or `.csharp`

  10 │         primitives: .int,
     │                     ^^^^

error BYN3101: `tabs` is not a field of `Style`

  11 │         tabs: true,
     │         ^^^^
     │
  help: use one of the fields `indent`, `braces`, `maxLine`, `trailingCommas`, `booleans`,
        `primitives`
